      "powerDrawWatts": 4.5,
      "notes": "Multi-effect pedal: four reorderable modules of five effects, with a looper/sustainer. Unlike the Microcosm, the stereo input is two separate TS jacks, and it routes automatically: one input to both outputs for mono to stereo, both inputs to one output for stereo to mono. Max input +8 dBu, 1 MOhm input impedance, output under 1 kOhm. Full-size 5-pin DIN MIDI in and out, plus a USB-C port that carries MIDI from a computer. TRS expression input wants a pedal of 10 kOhm or more. Needs 9 V DC at 500 mA or more on a centre-negative 2.1 mm barrel. I/O and power from Hologram's user manual; powerDrawWatts is that supply rating, not a measured draw. Hologram do not publish a size or weight: the dimensions are the 6 x 5 x 3 in given by third-party listings, and weight is left out.",
